msgstr "Rhydd"

#: adjustcurves.cpp:185
msgid ""
"<p>Select here the curve type to draw for the current "
"channel.<p><b>Smooth</b>: this mode constrains the curve type to a smooth "
"line with tension.<p><b>Free</b>: with this mode, you can draw your curve "
"free-hand with the mouse."
msgstr ""

